version 0.3
page charger-power

# BQ24610 power path, per datasheet SLUS892D Figure 20.
# 19V adapter, 3-cell Li-ion (12.6V), 4A adapter limit, 3A charge,
# 0.3A precharge/termination, 5-hour safety timer.
# A page of the charger-buck board: nets and refdes inside the page are local,
# visible to the board level only through the ports exposed by the ports section.
# Add mechanical interfaces such as connectors to the matching nets once they are settled; ports and the board root stay unchanged.
